* tlswg/draft-ietf-tls-esni (+6/-8/=F0=9F=92=AC5)
  6 pull requests submitted:
  - Quick editorial pass. (by dmcardle)
    https://github.com/tlswg/draft-ietf-tls-esni/pull/365=20
  - Remove backticks from empty string literal. (by dmcardle)
    https://github.com/tlswg/draft-ietf-tls-esni/pull/364=20
  - Move some text around in Server Behavior. (by davidben)
    https://github.com/tlswg/draft-ietf-tls-esni/pull/363=20
  - Authenticate the context handle to HPKE encryption (by cjpatton)
    https://github.com/tlswg/draft-ietf-tls-esni/pull/362=20
  - Copy the entire extension on HRR + GREASE for now. (by davidben)
    https://github.com/tlswg/draft-ietf-tls-esni/pull/361=20
  - Add is_client_hello_inner extension. (by cbartle891)
    https://github.com/tlswg/draft-ietf-tls-esni/pull/360=20

  3 pull requests received 5 new comments:
  - #364 Remove backticks from empty string literal. (2 by chris-wood, dmca=
rdle)
    https://github.com/tlswg/draft-ietf-tls-esni/pull/364=20
  - #360 Add is_client_hello_inner extension. (2 by chris-wood, cjpatton)
    https://github.com/tlswg/draft-ietf-tls-esni/pull/360=20
  - #353 Derive accept confirmation from the handshake secret  (1 by ekr)
    https://github.com/tlswg/draft-ietf-tls-esni/pull/353=20

  8 pull requests merged:
  - Remove backticks from empty string literal.
    https://github.com/tlswg/draft-ietf-tls-esni/pull/364=20
  - Move some text around in Server Behavior.
    https://github.com/tlswg/draft-ietf-tls-esni/pull/363=20
  - Copy the entire extension on HRR + GREASE for now.
    https://github.com/tlswg/draft-ietf-tls-esni/pull/361=20
  - Require HRR-sensitive parameters match in ClientHello(Outer|Inner).
    https://github.com/tlswg/draft-ietf-tls-esni/pull/316=20
  - Add is_client_hello_inner extension.
    https://github.com/tlswg/draft-ietf-tls-esni/pull/360=20
  - Bind the context handle to encrypted payload
    https://github.com/tlswg/draft-ietf-tls-esni/pull/362=20
  - Use the same HPKE context between the two ClientHellos
    https://github.com/tlswg/draft-ietf-tls-esni/pull/352=20
  - Derive accept confirmation from the handshake secret=20
    https://github.com/tlswg/draft-ietf-tls-esni/pull/353=20

* tlswg/tls13-spec (+1/-0/=F0=9F=92=AC0)
  1 pull requests submitted:
  - Align TLS 1.2 terminology with this document (by davidben)
